  "a ready paragraph, the facts, the 60 second video in three formats, the logo for dark and light, screenshots and a ZIP of everything. Design pass, part one: red is reserved for offline and down, refusals and the fork step are white with ✕ or a strike; fewer boxes inside Rule changes; panel subtitles in sentence case, instructions moved into the (i) hover; Rules in force now shows revision and fee large and the rest as one sentence; header chips show the value only, the name is in the hover, and a new Consensus chip says who seals blocks; validator keys in the chain state are short with a copy button; the background rain is off unless you switch it on.": "现成的介绍段落、事实数据、三种格式的 60 秒视频、深色和浅色版标志、截图以及全部内容的 ZIP。设计调整第一部分：绿色只用于离线和故障，拒绝和分叉步骤用白色加 ✕ 或删除线表示；“规则变更”内部的框更少；面板副标题使用句子格式，操作说明移入 (i) 悬停提示；“当前生效的规则”以大字显示版本和手续费，其余用一句话概括；页眉标签只显示数值，名称放在悬停提示中，新的“共识”标签说明谁在封装区块；链状态中的验证者密钥缩短显示并带复制按钮；背景字符雨默认关闭，需手动开启。",
