  "proposing": "提议中",
  "Public key": "公钥",
  "QR code next to the donation address (scan to donate). No more hexagons: the core is built from rings and the rule-holding accounts are ringed dots. “How a rule changes” laid out on one shared grid: both rows use the same four columns, each step has a one-line note, the clock sits with the row label, and the Tau row shows the live vote count and activation block.": "捐赠地址旁加了二维码（扫码捐赠）。不再使用六边形：核心由圆环构成，持有规则的账户是带圈的圆点。“规则如何改变”使用同一网格排版：两行使用相同的四列，每一步有一行说明，时钟放在行标签旁，Tau 一行显示实时票数和生效区块。",
  "QR code of the donation address": "捐助地址的二维码",
  "Rain": "字符雨",
  "Read from the community node (getgovernance): the active validator set, the vote_quorum policy and the approval threshold, all bound into the state hash. Threshold = ⌈2N/3⌉ for supermajority.": "从社区节点读取（getgovernance）：活跃验证者集合、vote_quorum 策略和通过门槛，全部绑定在状态哈希中。超级多数门槛 = ⌈2N/3⌉。",
  "Read from the node at wss://node.tauhud.com.": "从 wss://node.tauhud.com 上的节点读取。",
  "Read from the node; the relay pushes each new block as it is sealed.": "从节点读取；中继会在每个新区块封装时推送。",
  "README §Governance ↗": "README §治理 ↗",
  "README §Retractable ↗": "README §可撤回转账 ↗",
  "Reads the node every 3 s (getblocks, getmempool) and governance every 15 s; the relay pushes new blocks as they arrive.": "每 3 秒读取一次节点（getblocks、getmempool），每 15 秒读取一次治理数据；中继会在新区块到达时推送。",
  "Rebrand: Tau’s near-black and blue-to-violet gradient for structure, phosphor green reserved for data and truth, champagne for agreement. Matrix glyph rain behind the deck, the thesis decodes on load, hairline glass panels, Sora + JetBrains Mono. AGRS donation address under About.": "品牌更新：用 Tau 的近黑色和蓝到紫的渐变构建结构，荧光强调色专用于数据和真值，香槟色表示共识。面板后方是矩阵字符雨，主旨在加载时解码显现，细线玻璃面板，Sora + JetBrains Mono 字体。“关于”中加入 AGRS 捐赠地址。",
  "Recent effects": "近期效果",
  "Recipient": "接收方",
  "Recipient whitelist": "收款白名单",
  "Reconnecting in {x1} s …": "{x1} 秒后重新连接 …",
  "Refused": "被拒绝",
  "refused": "被拒绝",
  "Refused at the door, never entered a block": "在门口被拒绝，从未进入区块",
  "refused · spec does not compile": "被拒绝 · 规范无法编译",
  "rejected": "已拒绝",
  "Rejected by the recipient; nothing changed.": "被接收方拒绝；没有任何变化。",
  "Renamed to “Tau HUD”. Tau steps show their state: done (green), in progress (amber, gently pulsing, e.g. “collecting 2/3”), next (dimmed). Disclaimer added (experimental, no claim of accuracy, no advice). Tau step boxes given room. Any clipped text (step notes, hashes, rule names, transaction rows) shows in full as an overlay on hover, or on tap on phones. “How a rule changes” now encodes time as length, so both tracks compare on one scale: the Other-chains track spans the whole row with its slow, fragmenting steps (months of debate, a fork that can split the chain, manual upgrades), the Tau track is a short green segment followed by “done.”": "更名为“Tau HUD”。Tau 的步骤显示状态：完成（红色）、进行中（琥珀色，轻轻闪动，例如“收集中 2/3”）、下一步（变暗）。加入免责声明（实验性，不保证准确，不构成建议）。Tau 步骤框有了更多空间。任何被截断的文字（步骤说明、哈希、规则名称、交易行）悬停时以浮层完整显示，手机上点按即可。“规则如何改变”现在用长度表示时间，放在同一刻度上比较：其他链的轨道以缓慢、分裂的步骤占满整行（数月的争论、可能使链分裂的分叉、手动升级），Tau 的轨道是一小段红色，后面跟着“完成”。",
  "Reorg: block #{x1} replaced, {x2} block{x3} deep · the node switched to a heavier branch": "重组：区块 #{x1} 被替换，深度 {x2} 个区块 · 节点切换到了更重的分支",
