  "Rule Playground: a new page at": "规则试验场：新页面",
  "Rule Playground: a new page at {e1} where you write your own transfer rule and run the testnet’s own checks on it, or take a simulated validator seat and vote a rule change into law. Linked from the header (“Playground”) and from the validators panel.": "规则试验场：新页面 {e1}，你可以在这里编写自己的转账规则，并用测试网自己的检查来运行它；或者坐上一个模拟的验证者席位，投票让一项规则变更成为法律。可从页眉（“试验场”）和验证者面板进入。",
  "Rule sharing": "规则共享",
  "Rule sharing lines wrap instead of ending in “…”": "规则共享的行会自动换行，不再以“…”结尾",
  "Rule sharing lines wrap instead of ending in “…”; laptops (1280–1599 px wide or under 900 px tall) get a compact four-column step so the page is about 1.6 screens instead of 2.7; no type below 10 px on desktop, and ultra-wide screens scale the HUD a little more.": "规则共享的行会自动换行，不再以“…”结尾；笔记本电脑（宽 1280–1599 px 或高不足 900 px）使用紧凑的四列步骤布局，页面约为 1.6 屏而不是 2.7 屏；桌面端没有小于 10 px 的文字，超宽屏上 HUD 放大得更多一些。",
  "Rule sharing, rule changes and personal rules: hovers cut to the essentials. No live panel re-renders while the pointer rests on it, so an open overlay stays until you move away.": "规则共享、规则变更和个人规则：悬停说明只保留要点。指针停在实时面板上时，面板不再重绘，打开的浮层会一直保留到你移开。",
