  "Seals blocks in turn, votes on rule changes.": "轮流封装区块，对规则变更投票。",
  "Second approval": "二次批准",
  "Second approval: {x}. A transfer above the threshold parks on the chain as an approval request and executes by itself the moment the approver signs; unsigned, it expires and the money stays.": "第二次审批：{x}。超过阈值的转账作为审批请求暂存在链上，审批人签名的那一刻自动执行；未签名则过期，资金留在原处。",
  "see it: Personal money rules": "查看：个人资金规则",
  "see it: Rule changes · “compiled in isolation ✓”": "查看：规则变更 · “单独编译 ✓”",
  "see it: Transactions · red “✕ refused”": "查看：交易 · “✕ 被拒绝”",
  "see it: Validators · “agreement needed”": "查看：验证者 · “所需同意数”",
  "See the rules in force at this block (time travel) ›": "查看此区块时生效的规则（时光回溯）›",
  "See the transaction on Etherscan": "在 Etherscan 上查看该交易",
  "seen on the testnet": "已在测试网上看到",
  "Sender": "发送方",
  "Sender has no own rule": "发送方没有自有规则",
  "sender {x}": "发送方 {x}",
  "Sender’s own rule": "发送方自己的规则",
  "Sender’s own rule: only pays {h}. The rule said no, so the node refused it, whoever holds the key. Refused at the door, never entered a block.": "发送方自己的规则：只付款给 {h}。规则说不，所以节点拒绝了它，无论谁持有密钥。在门口被拒绝，从未进入区块。",
  "Sender’s own rule: {x1}.": "发送方自己的规则：{x1}。",
  "Sender’s own rule: {x}.": "发送方自己的规则：{x}。",
  "sends every rule change, chain restart, a weekly recap and each HUD update to your phone, so you do not need to check this page. Ask": "把每一次规则变更、链重启、每周回顾和每次 HUD 更新推送到你的手机，你无需时常查看本页。可以问",
  "sendtx {h} admitted": "sendtx {h} 已接纳",
  "sendtx {h} admitted · {x} · est. fee {n}": "sendtx {h} 已接纳 · {x} · 预计手续费 {n}",
  "sendtx {h} rejected": "sendtx {h} 被拒绝",
  "sendtx {h} rejected: o5 = 0": "sendtx {h} 被拒绝：o5 = 0",
  "Settings: node address and Connect, background rain.": "设置：节点地址与连接、背景字符雨。",
  "Settings: node address, background rain": "设置：节点地址、背景字符雨",
  "setup is public": "部署方式是公开的",
  "shape ✓": "结构 ✓",
  "shape ✕": "结构 ✕",
  "Show {n} older versions": "显示 {n} 个更早的版本",
  "Show {x1} older versions": "显示 {x1} 个更早的版本",
  "showing #{x1} · back to newest ›": "正在显示 #{x1} · 回到最新 ›",
  "shows balance, own rules, offers, activity and refusals of any account; linked from the header, and on the live chain every address in the HUD (transactions, blocks, proposer, validators, rule holders, offers) links to its account.": "显示任意账户的余额、自有规则、规则提供、活动和被拒记录；可从页眉进入，在实时链上，HUD 中的每个地址（交易、区块、提议者、验证者、规则持有者、规则提供）都链接到对应账户。",
  "Signalling votes with no binding effect": "没有约束力的意向投票",
  "signature verified": "签名已验证",
  "Signed by {h} at block #{n}: the transfer executed by itself.": "{h} 在区块 #{n} 签署：转账已自动执行。",
  "SIM": "模拟",
  "Simple and Technical view mean more on the HUD: Simple says what each thing means, Technical adds keys, hashes, heights and stream names. Every hover text in the Chain core now comes in both versions, validators read V1, V2 in Simple and show their key in Technical, the block check hides stream names in Simple, transactions show kind and fee without the hash, and the Validators panel follows the view. The thesis and its four points stay as they are.": "HUD 上的简洁视图和技术视图区别更明显：简洁视图说明每样东西的含义，技术视图另外显示密钥、哈希、高度和流名称。链核心的每条悬停说明现在都有两个版本；验证者在简洁视图中显示为 V1、V2，在技术视图中显示其密钥；区块检查在简洁视图中隐藏流名称；交易显示类型和手续费而不显示哈希；验证者面板跟随视图切换。主旨及其四个要点保持不变。",
  "Simple view: what each thing means, in words. No keys, hashes or stream names; validators are V1, V2…; transactions show their kind and fee; the node log is hidden.": "简洁视图：用文字说明每样东西的含义。不显示密钥、哈希或流名称；验证者显示为 V1、V2…；交易显示类型和手续费；隐藏节点日志。",
  "Simple/Technical switch moved to the right side of the header, under the status chips.": "简洁/技术切换移到了页眉右侧，状态标签下方。",
  "simulated": "模拟",
  "Simulation": "模拟",
  "Simulation follows the documented protocol: validators vote on rule changes, accounts write and share their own Tau rules, every block is checked by Tau. Switch to Live node to read the real testnet through the community relay, or your own node.": "模拟遵循公开文档中的协议：验证者对规则变更投票，账户编写并共享自己的 Tau 规则，每个区块都由 Tau 检查。切换到“实时节点”即可通过社区中继或你自己的节点读取真实测试网。",
  "Simulation is the default view again for now: the community node sits on an orphan chain until IDNI publishes the current genesis, so its blocks are not the real tip. Live node and its light stay one click away; Live becomes the default again once the node follows the real chain.": "模拟暂时重新成为默认视图：在 IDNI 发布当前创世区块之前，社区节点停留在一条孤立链上，所以它的区块并不是真实的最新区块。实时节点及其指示灯仍然一键可达；节点跟上真实链后，实时模式会重新成为默认。",
  "Simulation vs. live node": "模拟与实时节点",
  "Simulation · no real chain data": "模拟 · 非真实链上数据",
  "Simulation: invented activity that follows the documented protocol, generated in your browser. No real chain data.": "模拟：按公开协议在你的浏览器中生成的虚构活动。不是真实链上数据。",
  "Simulation: invented but protocol-true activity, no real chain data.": "模拟：虚构但符合协议的活动，不是真实链上数据。",
  "since #{n}": "自 #{n}",
  "Someone writes a proposal in a forum": "有人在论坛上写提案",
  "Something broken": "出了问题",
  "SPEC AMENDED · REV {n}": "规范已修订 · 版本 {n}",
  "SPEC AMENDED · revision {n} active · “{x}” · the chain now runs on the rules its validators agreed on": "规范已修订 · 版本 {n} 生效 · “{x}” · 链现在按其验证者同意的规则运行",
  "SPEC AMENDED · revision {x1} active · “{x2}” · the chain now runs on the rules its validators agreed on": "规范已修订 · 版本 {x1} 生效 · “{x2}” · 链现在运行在其验证者同意的规则上",
  "spec does not compile": "规范无法编译",
  "SPEC REV {n}": "规范版本 {n}",
  "Spec revision": "规范版本",
  "spec revision": "规范版本",
  "Spec revision {n}: how many times the consensus rules have changed by agreement (genesis = 1). Click to see every rule in force right now.": "规范版本 {n}：共识规则经同意修改的次数（创世 = 1）。点击查看当前生效的所有规则。",
  "Spending limit": "消费限额",
  "Spending limit: blocks transfers above {x}; anything above is refused by the account itself": "消费限额：阻止超过 {x} 的转账；超出部分由账户自身拒绝",
  "Spending limit: {x}; anything above is refused by the account itself.": "消费限额：{x}；超出部分由账户本身拒绝。",
  "splits": "分裂",
  "Stake": "质押",
  "Stake-based: the Tau rules judge eligibility by stake (stream o7).": "基于质押：Tau 规则按质押判断资格（数据流 o7）。",
