  "“How a rule changes”: one proposal at a time, so every run starts at propose and each step lights up in real time. The Tau row now ends under “vote”; fork, splits and upgrading by hand belong to the other chains only. The “length = time” caption is gone.": "“规则如何改变”：一次只显示一个提案，所以每一轮都从提议开始，每一步实时点亮。Tau 一行现在止于“投票”下方；分叉、分裂和手动升级只属于其他链。“长度 = 时间”的说明已移除。",
